  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**frac{{frac{{27}}{{14}} div frac{{24}}{7}offrac{{63}}{{28}} - (9)/(4)}}{{frac{{35}}{8} div frac{{15}}{4}of(7)/({48)} + (5)/({16)}}} div frac{{196}}{{95}}**\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n**BODMAS**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\n**Calculations:**\n\nfrac{{frac{{27}}{{14}} div frac{{24}}{7}offrac{{63}}{{28}} - (9)/(4)}}{{frac{{35}}{8} div frac{{15}}{4}of(7)/({48)} + (5)/({16)}}} div frac{{196}}{{95}}\n\n= frac{{frac{{27}}{{14}} div (frac{{24}}{7}×frac{{63}}{{28}}) - (9)/(4)}}{{frac{{35}}{8} div (frac{{15}}{4}×(7)/({48)}) + (5)/({16)}}} div frac{{196}}{{95}}\n\n= frac{{frac{{27}}{{14}} div (54)/(7) - (9)/(4)}}{{frac{{35}}{8} div (35)/(64) + (5)/({16)}}} ×frac{{95}}{{196}}\n\n=frac{{frac{{27}}{{14}} ×(7)/(54) - (9)/(4)}}{{frac{{35}}{8} × (64)/(35) + (5)/({16)}}} ×(95)/(196)\n\n= (frac{1)/(4)-(9)/(4)}{8+(5)/(16)}×(95)/(196)\n\n= (-2)/(frac{133){16}}×(95)/(196)\n\n= (-40)/(343)\n\n**therefore The simplified value is (-40)/(343).**\n\n105:Td",
